-- Regeneration of HP and MP as gear stats (docs/PHASE2.md 2o): `hpRegen` and `mpRegen` (points a second), `hpRegenPct` and `mpRegenPct` (percent of the maximum a minute)
-- join the stats of the gear master table, for the belt, the ring, the necklace and the jade. This replaces the per-kind weights (`gearRegen`) of the first version.
-- 1. the master rows that exist get the new range (json_insert: a row an admin already gave the stat keeps theirs); the rows that do not exist yet are seeded by the server with it;
-- 2. every piece of these kinds that already has rolled stats gets the new stat rolled in the range of its master row and its grade (the way a new piece is rolled);
--    pieces without rolled stats use the formula, which now includes it.

UPDATE equipment_master SET stats = json_insert(stats, '$.hpRegen', json('[1,2]')) WHERE item_key = 'belt.u.0.1';
